{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[PLAY THE FREE DEMO]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>CHAIN CORP</strong> is a deckbuilder set in a corporate hellscape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your job to build a deck of cards strong enough to take out the many CEOs of<strong> CHAIN CORP</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/641bf0e7175ff3ac41c1dba22db203dc.poster.avif?t=1771879350\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/641bf0e7175ff3ac41c1dba22db203dc.webm?t=1771879350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/641bf0e7175ff3ac41c1dba22db203dc.mp4?t=1771879350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[MECHANICS]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crack packs</strong> to collect new cards and assemble a <strong>20-card deck</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform well and you can <strong>earn cards for future runs</strong>, shaping your long-term strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/adcb9907692c5ecd85835623a9a1b5cf.poster.avif?t=1771879350\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/adcb9907692c5ecd85835623a9a1b5cf.webm?t=1771879350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/adcb9907692c5ecd85835623a9a1b5cf.mp4?t=1771879350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards are played onto <strong>FIELD SLOTS</strong> that can be <strong>created or destroyed</strong> during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy <strong>CHARACTER cards</strong> that stand their ground and fight directly on the field.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/77ffd4f4e4594fa41bc21834c18fe182.poster.avif?t=1771879350\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/77ffd4f4e4594fa41bc21834c18fe182.webm?t=1771879350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/77ffd4f4e4594fa41bc21834c18fe182.mp4?t=1771879350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a unique <strong>BUDGET and SALARY</strong> resource system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let <strong>CORRUPTION</strong> rise too far and enemies grow stronger while chaotic effects spiral out of control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/61a0d71e167e794691a880b78178fee5.poster.avif?t=1771879350\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/61a0d71e167e794691a880b78178fee5.webm?t=1771879350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/extras/61a0d71e167e794691a880b78178fee5.mp4?t=1771879350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIQUIDATE</str